TY  - JOUR
TI  - Prognostic impact of early adjunctive corticosteroid therapy in non-HIV oncology or haematology patients with Pneumocystis jirovecii pneumonia: A propensity score analysis
AU  - Assal M.
AU  - Lambert J.
AU  - Chow-Chine L.
AU  - Bisbal M.
