AB  - Background: The effectiveness of echinocandins combined with trimethoprimsulfamethoxazole (TMP-SMX) for treating HIV-negative patients with Pneumocystis jirovecii pneumonia (PJP) remains unclear. We conducted a systematic review and meta-analysis to evaluate whether this combination regimen improves clinical outcomes in this population.
